[2026-08-11T15:25:00+05:30] Wire insights feed to the real Payload schema + seed content
├── Discovery: GraphQL introspection is disabled on the Payload instance, so the schema was
│   recovered by probing field names against error messages on the LinkedinPost type.
│   └── Actual collection `linkedin-posts` fields: id, title, text, status, createdAt, updatedAt
│       └── status enum = draft | scheduled | posted   (NO url, NO image, NO publishedAt field)
├── File: src/environments/environment.ts
│   ├── payloadPostsCollection -> 'linkedin-posts' (was the placeholder 'posts')
│   └── payloadPublishedStatus -> 'posted'
├── File: src/app/services/linkedin-posts.service.ts
│   ├── sort=-createdAt (was -publishedAt; Payload errors on an unknown sort key)
│   ├── where[status][equals]=posted -> drafts and scheduled posts stay off the site
│   └── Added fullText + toPlainTextPreservingBreaks() to keep paragraph breaks
├── File: src/app/shared/post-card/post-card.component.ts
│   ├── Choice: expand-in-place "Read full post" toggle when a post has no permalink
│   │   └── Reason: the collection stores no url, so a link-out card would be dead; expanding
│   │              keeps every post fully readable on-site. Link-out still wins when a url exists.
│   └── canExpand guard -> toggle only appears when fullText actually exceeds the excerpt
└── Content: seeded 10 posts into the linkedin-posts collection (status=posted), oldest first
    so -createdAt ordering matches the original LinkedIn chronology.
